# OWASP Top 10:2025

Fuente: https://owasp.org/Top10/2025/

| ID | Riesgo | Qué hacer aquí |
|----|--------|----------------|
| A01 | Broken Access Control | UUIDs; sin admin público; mutaciones de stock solo en use cases |
| A02 | Security Misconfiguration | Helmet, HTTPS, CORS allowlist, sin stacktrace en prod |
| A03 | Software Supply Chain Failures | lockfiles; deps mínimas; `npm audit` |
| A04 | Cryptographic Failures | TLS; secrets en env/SSM; nunca PAN/CVV |
| A05 | Injection | Prisma parametrizado; validar DTOs |
| A06 | Insecure Design | Fees server-side; reserva atómica; fail-closed |
| A07 | Authentication Failures | Guest documentado; no hardcode keys |
| A08 | Software/Data Integrity Failures | Verificar integrity/webhook; no confiar montos del cliente |
| A09 | Logging & Alerting Failures | Logs con transactionId/resultado **sin** tarjeta |
| A10 | Mishandling Exceptional Conditions | Timeouts; ROP; no bajar stock si el estado es dudoso |

Headers mínimos: CSP, HSTS, X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy, frame denial.

